    "content": "Ariz. Rev. Stat. § 41-1001\n\nIn this chapter, unless the context otherwise requires:\n\n1. \"Agency\" means any board, commission, department, officer or other administrative unit of this state, including the agency head and one or more members of the agency head or agency employees or other persons purporting to act by or on behalf of the agency.",
